# Cells that must never be chosen as logic, by synthesis or by any resizer.
#
# The physical-only cells have no function to map to, and the two complex gates
# are the ones OpenROAD Flow Scripts lists in DONT_USE_CELLS to keep routing
# congestion down.
TAPCELL_X1
FILLCELL_X1
FILLCELL_X2
FILLCELL_X4
FILLCELL_X8
FILLCELL_X16
FILLCELL_X32
ANTENNA_X1
AOI211_X1
OAI211_X1
